# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — Grand Architect
# =============================================================================
# Rules:
# 1. Runtime data, backups, logs, build outputs, secrets, and obsolete
#    screenshots are NEVER tracked.
# 2. AI-context manifests under .ai/ ARE tracked (they are the machine-readable
#    front door for new agents). Only .ai/generated/ is ephemeral.
# 3. Do NOT globally ignore *.png — a game engine needs tracked images
#    (icons, UI assets, test goldens, reference captures, docs).
# 4. The handoffs/ bundles ARE tracked. Only handoffs/*/artifacts/ is ephemeral.
# 5. Historical testimony (worklog.md, roadmap-state.json, recovery-manifest.json,
#    retrofit-audit-report.md) IS tracked but downranked in .ai/authority-map.json.
# =============================================================================

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/install-state.gz

# Testing
coverage/

# Next.js
.next/
out/
build/
dist/

# Production build info
*.tsbuildinfo
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Misc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.pem

# Debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
bun-debug.log*

# Local env files (SECRETS — never track)
.env
.env*.local
.env.development
.env.production

# Vercel
.vercel

# Runtime logs
*.log
dev.log
ws.log
watchdog.log
server.log
mini-service-*.log

# PID files
*.pid
.zscripts/dev.pid
.zscripts/*.pid

# Databases
db/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
prisma/dev.db

# Generated world data
data/world-store/
data/

# Crash reports (generated at runtime)
crash-reports/

# Backups
backups/
*.bundle

# Tool results / agent context (ephemeral)
tool-results/
agent-ctx/

# Uploads / downloads (user-supplied, not source)
upload/
download/
downloaded/
downloaded_v2/

# Screenshots — ephemeral runtime evidence only.
# Do NOT globally ignore *.png — a game engine needs tracked images
# (icons, UI assets, test goldens, reference captures, docs).
/screenshots/
/tool-results/*.png
/crash-reports/*.png

# Videos — ephemeral recordings
/screenshots/*.webm
/screenshots/*.mp4

# Recovery artifacts
recovery/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
run-dev.sh
retry-curl.sh
watchdog.sh

# AI context tooling — generated manifests are tracked (they are part of the
# repository's machine-readable front door), but generated *summaries* and
# per-task artifacts are ephemeral.
.ai/generated/
handoffs/*/artifacts/

# Evidence captures — ephemeral runtime evidence.
# Hand-curated evidence under evidence/handpicked/ may be tracked.
/evidence/generated/
/evidence/traces/
/evidence/video/
/artifacts/

# game build output (bun bundler)
.game-dist/

.gym-dist/
